  static FACTS = 'McCain Digital is a digital product studio in Bavaria, Germany, founded 2016. Two founders, no juniors and no account managers: Christian (builds and ships, engineering and operations) and Kathi (design and brand). Between them over twenty years in the industry. Contact: info@mccain-digital.com, Holderweg 1, 86869 Oberostendorf, Germany. Hours Monday to Friday 09:00-18:00 CET. Promise: a real reply within 24 hours, a fixed quote within 48. No sales call.\nFour services: (1) AI tools - production AI on the client\'s own data: RAG with citations and an abstain path, agents with guardrails and human approval, MCP tool servers with auth, rate limits and audit logging; model-agnostic (frontier APIs or open weights like Llama, Mistral, Qwen); proof of value 2-4 weeks on one workflow; typical 4-10 weeks; budget band EUR 20-60k. (2) Web apps - React, Next.js, TypeScript, PostgreSQL; Lighthouse budget in CI; clickable prototype within seven days; MVP typically 6-12 weeks; no published budget band (fixed quote within 48 hours). (3) Websites - hand-built, no page builder, semantic HTML, JSON-LD, sitemap, llms.txt, custom design; typically 3-6 weeks; budget band EUR 8-25k. (4) Software for companies - dashboards, internal tools, integrations (ERP, CRM, REST/SOAP, legacy), cloud or on-premise, full source in the client\'s repository, no lock-in, no per-seat licence; typically 8-14 weeks; budget band EUR 25-70k. Online shops: 6-10 weeks, EUR 15-35k.\nNative mobile apps (iOS/Android) are NOT offered; propose a web app instead.\nOwn product: md-recall - AI-native project memory for software teams; knowledge is stamped onto the git commit at write time and read back in microseconds for zero tokens; self-hosted, no telemetry, no upload; /md-recall/. The studio\'s own website scores 100/100/100/100 in Lighthouse with CLS 0 and TBT 0 ms.\nSelf-hosting is recommended for anything touching client data: your keys, your hardware. Clients get the repository and documentation. After launch the same two people stay available. When the studio is the wrong choice: if you need twenty people by Monday, if you want the cheapest bid, or if you need someone on site every day (the studio is in Bavaria and works remotely). Brands the founders worked for over two decades (career references, not clients of the studio): Porsche, Deutsche Bank, Apple, Microsoft, Blizzard, Deutsches Museum, Ravensburger, Travian, AOK. No client testimonials are published until cleared; never invent a client or a quote.';

